# Recipe of Lumen Setup (org.lumen.setup) for every model without its own one, read by tools/devices/assemble_app.py
# (find_recipe falls back to it): the shared modules the app imports plus the app, as the Z9X, RS30 and HB recipes build
# it (devices/<model>/app/*Setup.layers). Play 6 builds Z9xSetup from source through it (build_play6.sh SETUP_SRC=1).
# The folder alone does not compile since Setup imports org.lumen.system, org.lumen.ui, org.lumen.icons and org.lumen.qr.
app       Z9xSetup
# shared files taken from their one source (no copy in the app): the colour tokens and the network time zone lookup
# of apps/common, the Inter font of apps/core/lumen-menu (AirPlay and the package installer take it the same way)
file      apps/common/tokens.xml res/values/z9x_tokens.xml
file      apps/common/GeoIp.java src/org/lumen/common/GeoIp.java
file      apps/core/lumen-menu/assets/fonts/InterVariable.ttf assets/fonts/InterVariable.ttf
file      apps/core/lumen-menu/assets/fonts/OFL-Inter.txt assets/fonts/OFL-Inter.txt
# the shared texts (apps/core/lumen-common-strings): every text two places show, once
module    lumen-common-strings
module    lumen-system
module    lumen-ui
module    lumen-icons
module    lumen-qr
top       apps/LumenSetup
skip      build/ test/ tools/ *.apk CHANGES*.md README*.md SYNCED.txt .DS_Store BUILD_VERSION app.layers
